  "accepted": "Equivalent unsigned word zero-test for the scatter classification; no new helper, call or inline assembly.",
  "native_contract": "Original collision normalizes (kind-25)==0 using CLZ/LSR. For 32-bit unsigned d, d|(0-d) has its high bit set exactly when d is nonzero; XOR 1 after shifting returns exactly kind==25. Unsigned subtraction/negation is defined modulo 2^32, including every signed kind input. No reads, calls or side effects are added.",
  "native_scatter_zero_test": [
    "sub.w r1, r2, #25",
    "clz r1, r1",
    "lsrs r1, r1, #5",
    "str r1, [sp, #32]"
  ],
  "not_recovered_source": true,
